      "author": "Artin0r",
      "description": "## What's inside:\r\n<img width=\"1652\" height=\"709\" alt=\"Showcase\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb617cdb-80f1-4a01-9bc1-66d642d9f414\" />\r\n\r\n---\r\n- Plain Markdown boards | one .md file per board, human-editable and git-friendly\r\n- Drag & drop | cards between columns, columns reorderable\r\n- Rich cards | due dates, recurring tasks, tags, custom fields, inline checklists with progress\r\n- Archive column | archive instead of delete; recurring cards reschedule automatically\r\n- Filters | live search + tag chips\r\n- Auto-move | cards jump to a target column when all checklist items are done\r\n- Import/Export | CSV (full metadata) and Trello-compatible JSON\r\n- Card templates | reusable templates for quick creation\r\n- Embedded boards | live kanban blocks inside any note",
